-q210","subject":"English","subject_slug":"english","chapter_slug":"articles","chapter_title":"Articles","statement":"Choose the correct article to complete the sentence: \"He is ___ tallest boy in the class.\"","chapter_num":7,"node_kind":"topic","option_a":"an","option_b":"the","option_c":"a","option_d":null,"option_e":null,"correct_option":"b","explanation":"Superlatives like 'tallest' take the definite article 'the'.","difficulty":"medium","source":"claude-generated-ecat"}]$ecat_questions$::jsonb) as row_data(
